workbench draws on terminal-desk, a Claude Code plugin by Doonminus2
(https://github.com/Doonminus2/claude-code-TerminalDesk-Plugin), released under the MIT licence.

The card layout, "left undone", the context card, the prompt cache timer and the cost line are our own
code, written from the ideas in terminal-desk, with a few small helpers adapted from it. Each adapted
function carries a comment in the source naming the terminal-desk file it comes from.

